              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.8.2+LUK.8.3+LUK.8.4+LUK.8.5+LUK.8.6+LUK.8.7+LUK.8.8+LUK.8.9+LUK.8.10+LUK.8.11+LUK.8.12+LUK.8.13+LUK.8.14+LUK.8.15+LUK.8.16+LUK.8.17+LUK.8.18+LUK.8.19+LUK.8.20+LUK.8.21+LUK.8.22+LUK.8.23+LUK.8.24+LUK.8.25+LUK.8.26+LUK.8.27+LUK.8.28+LUK.8.29+LUK.8.30+LUK.8.31+LUK.8.32+LUK.8.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 8.2-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golli Mana Waaqa fulla lamati gubbaa gadi tarsae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guddaani askarti ka isa dura eju, aka inni akasi hafuura baafatu arginaani waan jed'e, D'uguma nami kunini Ilma Waaqaati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.8.2+LUK.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 8.2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nad'eeni garileeni waan kana fagoo ilaalte. Worra keesa, Mariamu Magdalenefi Mariamu haad'a Yakobo maand'ichafi Yose, ammalle Salometi jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiini gaafa Yesoni Galilaya jiru isa gula yaate hojateefi. Ammalle nad'eeni heddu d'ibiti, ta isa woliini Yerusalemu olqabatte achi jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awaala Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti galgaloomnaani Yusufuni, ka dira Arimathaya d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni nama gurra qabu, kora Yahudi keesa, ka d'ufiisa Finna Waaqa eegu. Guyyaani suni guyya Kurfefacha (akasi jechaani guyya Sabato dura jecha); tanaafi Yusufuni garaa jabaate, gara Pilato d'aqe, reefa Yeso kad'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilatoni, aka Yesoni yoosu due mame, gudda askarti yaame, aka Yesoni yoosu due gaafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gudda askarti ira d'ageennaani, inni reefa Yusufuti kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuni woya boofta bite, isa gadi buuse, woya taaniini mamare, goda d'akha keesaa boch'ani keesati awaale, d'akha toko afaanti gangalche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mariamu Magdalenefi Mariamu haad'a Yose, fulla Yeso iti awaalani argani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.15.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
